---
description: SprintA repository-wide product and engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `CONTEXT.md` at the repository root.

If editing `Frontend/**`, also follow `Frontend/AGENTS.md`. If editing `Backend/**`, also follow `Backend/AGENTS.md`.

Keep real data and API behavior intact, do not add a new UI framework, keep Scrum and Kanban semantics distinct, and prefer a small complete vertical slice over a broad refactor.
